{%- if request.locale.iso_code == 'en' -%}
<section class="wp-block-group alignfull hero has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained mg-cs-1240" style="min-height:72vh;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60)">

<div class="blob blob--rose" style="width:min(34vw,360px);aspect-ratio:1;top:6%;left:-7%;"></div>
<div class="blob blob--sage" style="width:min(26vw,290px);aspect-ratio:1;bottom:8%;right:-5%;"></div>

<div class="wp-block-group hero-split is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow">

<div class="hero__media hero__media--wide"><img src="{{ 'art-23.webp' | asset_url }}" width="1600" height="1187" alt="Gouache illustration: an alchemist’s table lit by candlelight, steaming vials and old books" decoding="async" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high"></div>

<div class="wp-block-group hero-split__text is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow">

<p class="hero__eyebrow">Together</p>

<h1 class="wp-block-heading">Collaborations</h1>

<p class="hero__lede has-large-font-size">I am always open to collaborative projects that resonate with my world. Whether you are a brand, a venue, an institution, or a fellow creator, I would be delighted to exchange with you about an idea, an image, or an artistic direction to develop together.</p>

<div class="wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex">
<div class="wp-block-button"><a class="wp-block-button__link wp-element-button" href="#formulaire">Submit a project</a></div>
<div class="wp-block-button is-style-outline"><a class="wp-block-button__link wp-element-button" href="{{ pages['portfolio'].url }}">View the portfolios</a></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>


<section class="wp-block-group alignfull atelier has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained mg-cs-720" style="padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60)">

<div class="blob blob--lilac" style="width:min(28vw,300px);aspect-ratio:1;top:10%;right:-6%;"></div>
<div class="blob blob--sage" style="width:min(24vw,260px);aspect-ratio:1;bottom:12%;left:-5%;"></div>
<figure class="art-float art-float--left" data-reveal><img src="{{ 'art-08.webp' | asset_url }}" width="1277" height="1600" alt="Gouache illustration: a woman with flowing golden hair in a library overgrown with ivy" decoding="async" loading="lazy"></figure>
<figure class="art-float art-float--right" data-reveal><img src="{{ 'art-19.webp' | asset_url }}" width="1162" height="1600" alt="Ink drawing: still life with a cello, sheet music and a bouquet on a draped table" decoding="async" loading="lazy"></figure>
<p class="has-text-align-center eyebrow">What I enjoy</p>
<h2 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-center">Projects that leave room for imagination</h2>

<p class="has-text-align-center has-large-font-size" style="margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)">I enjoy working on projects that leave room for sensitivity, poetry, and imagination, whether through illustration, a visual campaign, an object, a publication, or a custom creation. If you have a project in mind, feel free to get in touch and share a few details about your idea, your needs, and your intended timeline.</p>

<ul class="tags" data-reveal><li>illustration</li><li>visual campaign</li><li>object</li><li>publication</li><li>custom creation</li></ul>
</section>


<div class="wp-block-group alignwide band is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow">

<div class="wp-block-group band__head is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow">

<h2 class="wp-block-heading">How to submit a project</h2>
</div>

<div class="wp-block-group band__body is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow">

<p>If possible, please include:</p>


<ul class="wp-block-list"><li>a brief presentation of your project;</li><li>the type of collaboration you have in mind;</li><li>your desired timeline;</li><li>your budget or budget range;</li><li>any links, documents, or visuals that may help me better understand your request.</li></ul>


<p>I will take the time to read your message carefully and get back to you as soon as possible.</p>
</div>
</div>


<div class="wp-block-group alignwide form-band is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow" id="formulaire">
{% render 'request-form', type: 'collaboration' %}
</div>
